Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 18:28:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] refactor: use mxl-nmos for the NMOS node, keep the flow
 glue

backend/src/nmos/glue.rs maps flows with MXL blocks to the crate's
resources with Strom's keys, so every NMOS id stays the same, seeds
staged/active from the block properties as before, and keeps the
activation handler that restarts the flow (30 s timeout). node.rs,
http.rs and register.rs are now the crate; domain.rs and the settings
stay. The MAC and registry-URL tests moved to the crate with the code.
